      "content": "800mg sounds like a lot though... i'm still really nervous because i read that taking high doses of nsaid's during the first trimester can be really bad for fetal development. are you 100% sure that 800mg won't cause any issues? i'd hate to do something that actually causes a miscarriage just because i wanted to stop a headache.",
